Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Run arm M (Playwright MCP, no element-table loop) and
 capture Claude token cost with/without Jev

Fixed the Playwright MCP plugin config (headed default, missing chromium-1246 binary) so arm M
could actually run headless Chromium; ran 3 reps x 3 goals for arm M with success verified from
both the reported final URL and a freshly fetched copy of the page. Instrumented decision_claude.py
and text_model_claude_standing.py to also capture total_cost_usd (was already capturing token
usage), and re-ran arms J/H/S (27 runs) alongside arm M (9 runs) in one sweep so every arm's token
numbers come from the same day. Appended "Token cost with Jev versus without" to SPIKE-NOTES.md
with per-goal tables and an honest reading of where the comparison is weak.
